# Files on the server that a deploy must never delete, although they sit inside a folder that
# the NAS deploy (deploy_site.sh in tbwebdesign-server-infrastructure) syncs with --delete:
# what a plugin writes into its own folder while it runs.
#
# One rsync pattern per line, relative to the plugin or theme folder ("/" is that folder).

# Akeeba Backup: backup archives, its working files, and the settings file it generates.
/app/backups/***
/app/tmp/***
/helpers/private/***
/app/Solo/assets/private/***
